# Memory Bank Quickstart Commands

- Save a new memory:

  ```bash
  python tools/memory.py save --title "Task Title" --tags tag1,tag2 --notes "important metadata, fixes, templates"
  ```

- Search existing memories:

  ```bash
  python tools/memory.py search --query "keywords"
  ```

> Maintain a clean, organized, and actionable Memory Bank at all times to compound your efficiency over time.
